+Why do low-resource languages need evaluation beyond translating an English benchmark?	Inspect dialect, script, tasks, cultural context and qualified reference judgments.
+How can an AI dataset document permission without implying every ethical question is settled?	Trace licenses, consent scope, provenance and withdrawal limits.
+What does accessibility testing reveal that a general AI benchmark can miss?	Use consented assistive tasks, error consequences and actual user requirements.
