+| BANK-006-060 | Why does antimatter abundance create a cosmological question? | Compare observed asymmetry with identified theoretical explanations and limits. |
+| BANK-006-061 | What does a particle detector infer from tracks rather than photograph directly? | Trace signal, reconstruction and uncertainty in an official detector example. |
+| BANK-006-062 | How can an experiment search for a particle it has not detected? | Explain backgrounds, sensitivity and exclusion limits from published results. |
+| BANK-006-063 | What distinguishes a fundamental force from an effective interaction? | Compare definitions and scale using traceable physics sources. |
+| BANK-006-064 | Why does a new statistical excess require independent confirmation? | Inspect significance, trials, calibration and later data. |
