+| BANK-006-067 | How do observations constrain the interiors of distant stars? | Use primary asteroseismology methods and model uncertainties. |
+| BANK-006-068 | What makes a planet habitable in a specified scientific model? | Separate possible conditions, atmospheric evidence and actual detection of life. |
+| BANK-006-069 | How can an asteroid sample test ideas about solar-system formation? | Compare original mission measurements with contamination controls and models. |
+| BANK-006-070 | Why can a space image use colors that human eyes would not directly see? | Explain wavelength mapping, calibration and disclosure without calling processed data fake. |
