+| BANK-006-107 | How should a science channel assess a press release against the underlying study? | Compare population, design, outcomes and the limits omitted from publicity. |
+| BANK-006-108 | Why can scientific consensus coexist with disagreement about important details? | Specify the settled claims, active questions and evidence levels. |
+| BANK-006-109 | How can a failed replication narrow a theory rather than simply destroy it? | Compare methods, predictions and reproducibility before drawing a conclusion. |
