+|---|---|---|
+| BANK-007-018 | How reliably can an AI tool extract a table with merged cells? | Use known reference tables and score headers, units, spans and omissions separately from visual resemblance. |
+| BANK-007-019 | When does OCR fail before the language model even sees the document? | Compare scans, rotation, handwriting, scripts and layout; trace errors to extraction rather than blaming every failure on reasoning. |
+| BANK-007-020 | How can a summarization workflow preserve exceptions and qualifications? | Compare the summary with labeled source claims, dates and exclusions rather than judging only readability. |
+| BANK-007-021 | What checks should an AI-assisted citation workflow perform before export? | Verify source existence, passage support, quote accuracy and bibliographic fields using an auditable source list. |
+| BANK-007-022 | How can document question answering handle a later revision of the same policy? | Track version, date, superseded text and retrieval filters; test whether answers cite the applicable edition. |
