+| BANK-012-043 | How should a channel cover a preprint about a surprising astronomical result? | Check methods, uncertainty, expert critique and later revisions without presenting peer review as a guarantee or a missing seal of impossibility. |
+| BANK-012-044 | What remains unknown even after a spectacular new telescope image? | Identify the actual observation, inference range and follow-up needed rather than claiming a single image resolves cosmic history. |
