+| BANK-016-041 | How can a team test whether viewers understood the story's actual takeaway? | Ask about decisions, constraints and changes rather than measuring only how inspired viewers report feeling. |
+| BANK-016-042 | What separates a motivating possibility from a guaranteed success claim? | Make uncertainty, context and differing outcomes explicit while preserving a useful action or reflection. |
+| BANK-016-043 | How should a sponsored motivational video disclose its commercial purpose? | Identify the sponsor and relevant claims without disguising advertising as an independent life lesson. |
+| BANK-016-044 | How can a channel vary motivational stories without recycling one triumph formula? | Rotate conflicts, forms of progress, endings, communities and values while preserving concrete causal storytelling. |
