+| BANK-028-037 | How do long-term seabed observatories change questions researchers can ask? | Compare continuity, power, sensors and maintenance against intermittent vessel visits. |
+| BANK-028-038 | What can acoustic monitoring detect without showing the source directly? | Examine classification, background noise, range and validation with other observations. |
+| BANK-028-039 | How can remote sensing help select deep-sea survey sites? | Separate surface signals, bathymetric inference and direct habitat confirmation rather than claiming satellites see every seabed detail. |
