+| BANK-031-022 | What does a tuned mass damper control and leave unchanged? | Separate vibration response, wind loading, design assumptions and the building's other safety systems. |
+| BANK-031-023 | How can foundations support tall buildings on variable ground? | Use site investigations, settlement criteria and foundation choices rather than a universal depth rule. |
+| BANK-031-024 | Why does elevator planning affect a tower's usable floor area? | Compare capacity, waiting, zoning, shafts and occupancy assumptions in a documented design. |
