+| BANK-035-018 | How did Roman logistics support campaigning beyond the battlefield? | Bound region and period; examine roads, supplies, labor and local resources. |
+| BANK-035-019 | What did Mongol mobility depend on besides riding skill? | Compare remounts, communication, organization, landscape and supply within identified campaigns. |
+| BANK-035-020 | How did fortification design respond to changing siege technology? | Use dated structures and records rather than a universal sequence from primitive to advanced warfare. |
