+# 036 Royalty & Dynasties: Detailed Topic-Bank Draft
+
+**17 categories · 74 individually authored episode proposals.**
+
+Individually authored episode questions and coverage boundaries for Royalty & Dynasties. The subject progression is organized by concrete content rather than a topic-by-angle multiplication.
+
+[All-niche progress](../DEPTH_COMPLETION_STATUS.md) · [All-niche index](../ALL_NICHE_TOPIC_BANKS.md) · [Editable bank](./IN_DEPTH_TOPIC_BANK.json)
