+- [419 Supercars](../419_supercars/IN_DEPTH_TOPIC_BANK.md). Compare actual questions and keep one primary home for an episode.
+- [420 Electric Vehicles](../420_electric_vehicles/IN_DEPTH_TOPIC_BANK.md). Compare actual questions and keep one primary home for an episode.
+- [421 EV Battery Technology](../421_ev_battery_technology/IN_DEPTH_TOPIC_BANK.md). Compare actual questions and keep one primary home for an episode.
