+| ID | Specific episode question | Individually written scope and exclusions |
+|---|---|---|
+| BANK-047-037 | How did postal contracts contribute to early commercial aviation? | Trace routes, subsidies, reliability and institutional arrangements in a specific country. |
+| BANK-047-038 | What can overlooked aviation pioneers reveal about barriers to participation? | Use verified careers and contemporary records to examine access, discrimination and later recognition. |
+| BANK-047-039 | How did air transport change remote communities' connections? | Compare access to goods, services and mobility alongside costs and local perspectives. |
+| BANK-047-040 | What does an abandoned airfield reveal about changing military or commercial priorities? | Reconstruct its use, closure and later landscape through records rather than unexplained-ruin speculation. |
+
+## 08. Environment and emerging claims
+
+**Level:** advanced. **Evidence direction:** Use original observations or experiments, an appropriate scientific reference and the actual measurement method. Distinguish mechanisms, correlations, model assumptions, uncertainty and limits of generalization.
+
+**Source types to locate:** original research reports and data; research-institution observation records; methods papers and current scientific reference works. These are requirements, not sources already inspected.
+
+| ID | Specific episode question | Individually written scope and exclusions |
+|---|---|---|
+| BANK-047-041 | How should aviation climate impacts be compared across different boundaries? | Distinguish fuel emissions, non-carbon effects, per-passenger measures and uncertain assumptions using dated research. |
+| BANK-047-042 | What evidence is needed to evaluate a proposed low-emission aircraft? | Separate prototype performance, energy source, infrastructure and demonstrated service from promotional targets. |
+| BANK-047-043 | Why does aircraft noise depend on more than engine loudness? | Compare flight paths, altitude, operations and community exposure through published assessments. |
+| BANK-047-044 | How can a documentary test claims about the future of autonomous flight? | Identify demonstrated capability, operational limits, oversight and unresolved requirements without presenting forecasts as deployment facts. |
