+| BANK-055-014 | Why did standardizing time require institutions as well as accurate clocks? | Trace a defined history of railways, observatories and coordination using dated records. |
+| BANK-055-015 | How do calendar systems answer different questions from precise clocks? | Compare astronomical cycles, civil conventions and cultural purposes without ranking calendars as simply primitive or advanced. |
+| BANK-055-016 | What makes simultaneity a question that needs a reference frame? | Introduce explicit observers and signal assumptions in special relativity without implying every use of time is arbitrary. |
