+| BANK-055-017 | How does time dilation differ from a clock malfunction? | Explain proper time and comparison procedures through established experiments while avoiding unsupported numerical examples. |
+| BANK-055-018 | Why do motion and gravity affect clock comparisons in different ways? | Separate special- and general-relativistic descriptions with clear assumptions and authoritative source leads. |
+| BANK-055-019 | What does a spacetime diagram show and what does it leave out? | Explain coordinates, worldlines and causal structure through a limited schematic rather than treating the drawing as literal space. |
+| BANK-055-020 | How can relativity challenge a universal present without resolving every philosophy of time? | Separate formal results from presentist, eternalist and other interpretations with their assumptions explicit. |
