+| BANK-082-041 | What can a creator verify before reproducing a traditional pattern in a commercial design? | Investigate provenance, community authority, permissions and applicable intellectual-property rules; do not assume historic age or online visibility removes every restriction. |
+| BANK-082-042 | How can dress-code debates include wearers' experiences without stereotyping a community? | Use current policy text, attributed perspectives and documented implementation; separate personal preference, religious practice, workplace needs and legal questions. |
