+|---|---|---|
+| BANK-105-037 | How can a channel explain dark patterns without teaching businesses to deploy them? | Use regulator-defined public examples, user consequences and remedies; exclude implementation instructions for coercive or deceptive interfaces. |
+| BANK-105-038 | What evidence is needed before claiming that a marketing practice caused financial harm? | Trace exposure, transactions, alternatives and official findings in a bounded case; distinguish plausible mechanism from verified loss attribution. |
+| BANK-105-039 | How can behavioral insights support consumer understanding rather than undermine autonomy? | Compare transparent labels, easy comparison, reversible choices and evaluated outcomes; make the normative aim explicit and avoid promises of universal welfare gains. |
