+#### BANK-115-001 — Canopy gaps and succession
+
+**Video question:** Canopy gaps and succession: what mechanisms and measurements support the explanation?
+
+**Coverage boundary:** Primary context: Forests & Ecology; branch: Forest ecology. Address Canopy gaps and succession through one bounded case, source set or experiment. Exclude an all-purpose survey of the whole niche; distinguish the case's findings from broader claims.
