+#### BANK-117-001 — Climbing protection standards
+
+**Video question:** Climbing protection standards: how does it work, and where do its design assumptions fail?
+
+**Coverage boundary:** Primary context: Adventure & Extreme Sports; branch: Sport systems. Address Climbing protection standards through one bounded case, source set or experiment. Exclude an all-purpose survey of the whole niche; distinguish the case's findings from broader claims.
