+#### BANK-118-001 — Marie Curie's laboratory networks
+
+**Video question:** Marie Curie's laboratory networks: what do contemporary records establish, and what remains uncertain?
+
+**Coverage boundary:** Primary context: Scientists & Discoverers; branch: Scientific careers. Address Marie Curie's laboratory networks through one bounded case, source set or experiment. Exclude an all-purpose survey of the whole niche; distinguish the case's findings from broader claims.
+
+**Deep-dive research outline:**
+
+- Locate Marie Curie's laboratory networks in a bounded time and place; build a chronology from identified records.
+- Compare at least two independent witnesses or explain why only one survives.
+- Analyze institutions, material conditions and overlooked participants rather than attributing everything to a single figure.
+- Separate documented conclusions, interpretive debates and gaps that a reconstruction cannot resolve.
