+**Deep-dive research outline:**
+
+- State the exact question behind Validity versus soundness and identify any terms that different sources use differently.
+- Build a claim-by-claim comparison rather than contrasting slogans.
+- Identify a concrete example that distinguishes the explanations and inspect its evidence.
+- Explain what remains undecidable, what evidence is missing and what would justify revising the conclusion.
