+## Subject map
+
+| Category | Research mode | Topic proposals |
+|---|---|---:|
+| CATALOG-141-01: Material knowledge | history | 3 |
+| CATALOG-141-02: Food and household skills | community | 3 |
+| CATALOG-141-03: Transmission | community | 3 |
