+#### BANK-141-001 — Traditional lime mortar
+
+**Video question:** Traditional lime mortar: what do contemporary records establish, and what remains uncertain?
+
+**Coverage boundary:** Primary context: Traditional Skills; branch: Material knowledge. Address Traditional lime mortar through one bounded case, source set or experiment. Exclude an all-purpose survey of the whole niche; distinguish the case's findings from broader claims.
+
+**Deep-dive research outline:**
+
+- Locate Traditional lime mortar in a bounded time and place; build a chronology from identified records.
+- Compare at least two independent witnesses or explain why only one survives.
+- Analyze institutions, material conditions and overlooked participants rather than attributing everything to a single figure.
+- Separate documented conclusions, interpretive debates and gaps that a reconstruction cannot resolve.
+
+**Next action:** Select and inspect a concrete case and traceable sources; record unresolved questions before choosing a registered angle and promoting an episode idea.
