+**Video question:** Stone-tool reduction evidence: what do contemporary records establish, and what remains uncertain?
+
+**Coverage boundary:** Primary context: Primitive Technology; branch: Archaeological technologies. Address Stone-tool reduction evidence through one bounded case, source set or experiment. Exclude an all-purpose survey of the whole niche; distinguish the case's findings from broader claims.
