+
+**Video question:** Electrode reactions: how does it work, and where do its design assumptions fail?
+
+**Coverage boundary:** Primary context: Batteries & Energy Storage; branch: Battery fundamentals. Address Electrode reactions through one bounded case, source set or experiment. Exclude an all-purpose survey of the whole niche; distinguish the case's findings from broader claims.
