+#### BANK-171-001 — Delay discounting
+
+**Video question:** Delay discounting: what mechanisms and measurements support the explanation?
+
+**Coverage boundary:** Primary context: Human Behavior; branch: Decision behavior. Address Delay discounting through one bounded case, source set or experiment. Exclude an all-purpose survey of the whole niche; distinguish the case's findings from broader claims.
