+## Subject map
+
+| Category | Research mode | Topic proposals |
+|---|---|---:|
+| CATALOG-177-01: Political history | history | 3 |
+| CATALOG-177-02: Everyday history | history | 3 |
+| CATALOG-177-03: Source recovery | history | 3 |
