+| Category | Research mode | Topic proposals |
+|---|---|---:|
+| CATALOG-180-01: Financing | civic | 3 |
+| CATALOG-180-02: Service organization | civic | 3 |
+| CATALOG-180-03: Evaluation | health | 3 |
