+## Subject map
+
+| Category | Research mode | Topic proposals |
+|---|---|---:|
+| CATALOG-182-01: Response networks | civic | 3 |
+| CATALOG-182-02: Operational constraints | technical | 3 |
+| CATALOG-182-03: Evaluation | health | 3 |
