+A starting subject map for a Firefighting YouTube channel. Categories organize concrete subtopics; each entry supplies an episode question, a research outline and a boundary for case selection. Counts follow the authored coverage, with no imposed topic maximum.
+
+[All-niche index](../ALL_NICHE_TOPIC_BANKS.md) · [Editable JSON](./IN_DEPTH_TOPIC_BANK.json) · [Expansion method](../ALL_NICHE_EXPANSION_GUIDE.md)
