+| Category | Research mode | Topic proposals |
+|---|---|---:|
+| CATALOG-207-01: Rainforest structure | science | 3 |
+| CATALOG-207-02: Biodiversity | science | 3 |
+| CATALOG-207-03: Human pressures | civic | 3 |
