+**Coverage boundary:** Primary context: Sacred Geography; branch: Sacred landscapes. Address Shakti Peetha lists and variation through one bounded case, source set or experiment. Exclude an all-purpose survey of the whole niche; distinguish the case's findings from broader claims.
