+
+**Video question:** Holi's regional forms: how do named sources and interpreters explain it?
+
+**Coverage boundary:** Primary context: Festivals Around the World; branch: Seasonal festivals. Address Holi's regional forms through one bounded case, source set or experiment. Exclude an all-purpose survey of the whole niche; distinguish the case's findings from broader claims.
