+## Subject map
+
+| Category | Research mode | Topic proposals |
+|---|---|---:|
+| CATALOG-258-01: Painting traditions | history | 5 |
+| CATALOG-258-02: Materials | technical | 3 |
+| CATALOG-258-03: Living practice | community | 3 |
