+## Subject map
+
+| Category | Research mode | Topic proposals |
+|---|---|---:|
+| CATALOG-260-01: Sculptural materials | technical | 3 |
+| CATALOG-260-02: Historical contexts | history | 3 |
+| CATALOG-260-03: Interpretation | community | 3 |
