+#### BANK-266-001 — Kantha reuse practices
+
+**Video question:** Kantha reuse practices: what do contemporary records establish, and what remains uncertain?
+
+**Coverage boundary:** Primary context: Embroidery; branch: Stitch traditions. Address Kantha reuse practices through one bounded case, source set or experiment. Exclude an all-purpose survey of the whole niche; distinguish the case's findings from broader claims.
