+#### BANK-268-001 — Nyaya knowledge sources
+
+**Video question:** Nyaya knowledge sources: how do named sources and interpreters explain it?
+
+**Coverage boundary:** Primary context: Hindu Philosophy; branch: Classical schools. Address Nyaya knowledge sources through one bounded case, source set or experiment. Exclude an all-purpose survey of the whole niche; distinguish the case's findings from broader claims.
+
+**Deep-dive research outline:**
+
+- Identify the source passages, images or authorized descriptions that define Nyaya knowledge sources.
+- Explain key terms within their own literary, philosophical or devotional setting.
+- Compare a second attributed interpretation without merging distinct traditions or ranking spiritual truth.
+- Document what is uncertain, restricted, disputed or lost in translation; choose visuals that do not invent sacred attributes.
