+| Category | Research mode | Topic proposals |
+|---|---|---:|
+| CATALOG-270-01: Major Upanishads | tradition | 6 |
+| CATALOG-270-02: Extended texts | tradition | 4 |
+| CATALOG-270-03: Reading methods | history | 4 |
