+#### BANK-270-001 — Isha's opening verses
+
+**Video question:** Isha's opening verses: how do named sources and interpreters explain it?
+
+**Coverage boundary:** Primary context: Upanishads; branch: Major Upanishads. Address Isha's opening verses through one bounded case, source set or experiment. Exclude an all-purpose survey of the whole niche; distinguish the case's findings from broader claims.
+
+**Deep-dive research outline:**
+
+- Identify the source passages, images or authorized descriptions that define Isha's opening verses.
+- Explain key terms within their own literary, philosophical or devotional setting.
+- Compare a second attributed interpretation without merging distinct traditions or ranking spiritual truth.
+- Document what is uncertain, restricted, disputed or lost in translation; choose visuals that do not invent sacred attributes.
