+#### BANK-272-001 — Panchalakshana definitions
+
+**Video question:** Panchalakshana definitions: how do named sources and interpreters explain it?
+
+**Coverage boundary:** Primary context: Puranas; branch: Puranic structure. Address Panchalakshana definitions through one bounded case, source set or experiment. Exclude an all-purpose survey of the whole niche; distinguish the case's findings from broader claims.
