+#### BANK-273-001 — Shaiva Siddhanta categories
+
+**Video question:** Shaiva Siddhanta categories: how do named sources and interpreters explain it?
+
+**Coverage boundary:** Primary context: Shaivism; branch: Shaiva frameworks. Address Shaiva Siddhanta categories through one bounded case, source set or experiment. Exclude an all-purpose survey of the whole niche; distinguish the case's findings from broader claims.
