+# 276 Temple Traditions: Subject Coverage and Episode Proposals
+
+Updated: 2026-10-22 · **Initial subject map; proposed, not researched**
+
+**3 subject categories · 12 topic proposals.**
+
+A starting subject map for a Temple Traditions YouTube channel. Categories organize concrete subtopics; each entry supplies an episode question, a research outline and a boundary for case selection. Counts follow the authored coverage, with no imposed topic maximum.
