+
+| Primary home | Coverage rule |
+|---|---|
+| [278 Meditation](../278_meditation/278_MEDITATION_CHANNEL_TOPIC_ROADMAP.md) | Primary home for contemplative attention, named meditation methods, japa, meditation experience and meditation-program research. |
