+This first batch does not exhaust manuscript variants, regional teaching systems, instructor interviews, instrument-validation studies or condition-specific clinical evidence. Resolve each technique's edition and institutional definition before research. Advanced retention, bandha and forceful-breathing entries contain no practice ratios or progressions.
