+
+| Category | Research mode | Topic proposals |
+|---|---|---:|
+| CATALOG-281-01: Ayurvedic frameworks | tradition | 4 |
+| CATALOG-281-02: Texts and institutions | history | 4 |
+| CATALOG-281-03: Evidence and safeguards | health | 4 |
