+#### BANK-291-001 — Big Bang evidence
+
+**Video question:** Big Bang evidence: what mechanisms and measurements support the explanation?
+
+**Coverage boundary:** Primary context: Cosmology & Creation; branch: Scientific cosmology. Address Big Bang evidence through one bounded case, source set or experiment. Exclude an all-purpose survey of the whole niche; distinguish the case's findings from broader claims.
+
+**Deep-dive research outline:**
+
+- Define Big Bang evidence precisely and identify the scale, system or population being studied.
+- Explain the proposed mechanism with an observable example; distinguish model from direct observation.
+- Inspect how the key quantity is measured and which controls or comparison conditions matter.
+- Discuss uncertainty, alternative explanations and a result that would challenge the account.
