+## Subject map
+
+| Category | Research mode | Topic proposals |
+|---|---|---:|
+| CATALOG-293-01: Bank functions | finance | 3 |
+| CATALOG-293-02: Risk and regulation | finance | 3 |
+| CATALOG-293-03: Consumer systems | civic | 3 |
