+| Category | Research mode | Topic proposals |
+|---|---|---:|
+| CATALOG-294-01: Card mechanics | finance | 3 |
+| CATALOG-294-02: Costs and protections | finance | 3 |
+| CATALOG-294-03: Risk | civic | 3 |
