+| Category | Research mode | Topic proposals |
+|---|---|---:|
+| CATALOG-328-01: Evidence acquisition | technical | 3 |
+| CATALOG-328-02: Analysis | technical | 3 |
+| CATALOG-328-03: Legal and ethical scope | civic | 3 |
