+#### BANK-330-001 — Kinematics and degrees of freedom
+
+**Video question:** Kinematics and degrees of freedom: how does it work, and where do its design assumptions fail?
+
+**Coverage boundary:** Primary context: Robotics; branch: Robot fundamentals. Address Kinematics and degrees of freedom through one bounded case, source set or experiment. Exclude an all-purpose survey of the whole niche; distinguish the case's findings from broader claims.
