+| Category | Research mode | Topic proposals |
+|---|---|---:|
+| CATALOG-331-01: Embodied design | technical | 3 |
+| CATALOG-331-02: Perception | technical | 3 |
+| CATALOG-331-03: Deployment | civic | 3 |
