+#### BANK-332-001 — Multirotor control
+
+**Video question:** Multirotor control: how does it work, and where do its design assumptions fail?
+
+**Coverage boundary:** Primary context: Drones; branch: Flight systems. Address Multirotor control through one bounded case, source set or experiment. Exclude an all-purpose survey of the whole niche; distinguish the case's findings from broader claims.
