+| Category | Research mode | Topic proposals |
+|---|---|---:|
+| CATALOG-351-01: Neural systems | science | 3 |
+| CATALOG-351-02: Cognition and behavior | science | 3 |
+| CATALOG-351-03: Research tools | technical | 3 |
