+| Category | Research mode | Topic proposals |
+|---|---|---:|
+| CATALOG-352-01: Structural systems | health | 3 |
+| CATALOG-352-02: Organs | health | 3 |
+| CATALOG-352-03: Anatomical interpretation | health | 3 |
