+## Subject map
+
+| Category | Research mode | Topic proposals |
+|---|---|---:|
+| CATALOG-375-01: Horror structures | fiction | 3 |
+| CATALOG-375-02: Atmosphere | media | 3 |
+| CATALOG-375-03: Ethical adaptation | media | 3 |
