+#### BANK-377-001 — Friends negotiating changed feelings
+
+**Video question:** How could a story about Friends negotiating changed feelings develop conflict, consequences and a satisfying resolution?
+
+**Coverage boundary:** Primary context: Romance Stories; branch: Relationship stories. Address Friends negotiating changed feelings through one bounded case, source set or experiment. Exclude an all-purpose survey of the whole niche; distinguish the case's findings from broader claims.
