+## Subject map
+
+| Category | Research mode | Topic proposals |
+|---|---|---:|
+| CATALOG-384-01: Short-form narrative | media | 3 |
+| CATALOG-384-02: Production constraints | technical | 3 |
+| CATALOG-384-03: Distribution | civic | 3 |
