+| Category | Research mode | Topic proposals |
+|---|---|---:|
+| CATALOG-393-01: Space planning | technical | 3 |
+| CATALOG-393-02: Materials | technical | 3 |
+| CATALOG-393-03: Use and access | community | 3 |
