+**Video question:** Circulation clearance: how does it work, and where do its design assumptions fail?
+
+**Coverage boundary:** Primary context: Interior Design; branch: Space planning. Address Circulation clearance through one bounded case, source set or experiment. Exclude an all-purpose survey of the whole niche; distinguish the case's findings from broader claims.
