+## Subject map
+
+| Category | Research mode | Topic proposals |
+|---|---|---:|
+| CATALOG-397-01: Practical organization | technical | 3 |
+| CATALOG-397-02: Shared systems | community | 3 |
+| CATALOG-397-03: Evaluation | synthesis | 3 |
