+| Category | Research mode | Topic proposals |
+|---|---|---:|
+| CATALOG-400-01: Wood behavior | technical | 3 |
+| CATALOG-400-02: Joinery | technical | 3 |
+| CATALOG-400-03: Workshop practice | technical | 3 |
