+#### BANK-424-001 — Hull form selection
+
+**Video question:** Hull form selection: how does it work, and where do its design assumptions fail?
+
+**Coverage boundary:** Primary context: Shipbuilding; branch: Vessel design. Address Hull form selection through one bounded case, source set or experiment. Exclude an all-purpose survey of the whole niche; distinguish the case's findings from broader claims.
