+#### BANK-426-001 — Pavement layers
+
+**Video question:** Pavement layers: how does it work, and where do its design assumptions fail?
+
+**Coverage boundary:** Primary context: Roads & Highways; branch: Road design. Address Pavement layers through one bounded case, source set or experiment. Exclude an all-purpose survey of the whole niche; distinguish the case's findings from broader claims.
+
+**Deep-dive research outline:**
+
+- Map the components and operating conditions behind Pavement layers.
+- Trace a worked example using a diagram, calculation or observed system; state all numerical assumptions.
+- Compare an alternative design against the same requirements; include cost, reliability and accessibility where relevant.
+- Examine a failure mode, measurement error or edge case and show what evidence would change the explanation.
