+| Category | Research mode | Topic proposals |
+|---|---|---:|
+| CATALOG-454-01: Student transitions | community | 3 |
+| CATALOG-454-02: Practical systems | finance | 3 |
+| CATALOG-454-03: Support | civic | 3 |
