+#### BANK-454-001 — First-year belonging
+
+**Video question:** First-year belonging: how do participants describe the practice and its differences?
+
+**Coverage boundary:** Primary context: Student Life; branch: Student transitions. Address First-year belonging through one bounded case, source set or experiment. Exclude an all-purpose survey of the whole niche; distinguish the case's findings from broader claims.
+
+**Deep-dive research outline:**
+
+- Choose a specific community and identify who participates in First-year belonging and who may be excluded.
+- Document the actual routines, resources and relationships involved through more than one perspective.
+- Compare change across generations, locations or life circumstances without assuming uniformity.
+- Return to participants for context and consent checks; distinguish their views from the narrator's interpretation.
