+| Category | Research mode | Topic proposals |
+|---|---|---:|
+| CATALOG-455-01: Career decisions | community | 3 |
+| CATALOG-455-02: Pathways | civic | 3 |
+| CATALOG-455-03: Evaluation | finance | 3 |
