+## Subject map
+
+| Category | Research mode | Topic proposals |
+|---|---|---:|
+| CATALOG-457-01: Remote workflows | technical | 3 |
+| CATALOG-457-02: People | community | 3 |
+| CATALOG-457-03: Practical constraints | civic | 3 |
