+| Category | Research mode | Topic proposals |
+|---|---|---:|
+| CATALOG-460-01: AI role families | technical | 3 |
+| CATALOG-460-02: Portfolio evidence | technical | 3 |
+| CATALOG-460-03: Career literacy | civic | 3 |
