+| Category | Research mode | Topic proposals |
+|---|---|---:|
+| CATALOG-462-01: Data roles | technical | 3 |
+| CATALOG-462-02: Portfolio projects | technical | 3 |
+| CATALOG-462-03: Professional practice | civic | 3 |
