+#### BANK-462-001 — Analytics versus data engineering
+
+**Video question:** Analytics versus data engineering: how does it work, and where do its design assumptions fail?
+
+**Coverage boundary:** Primary context: Data Careers; branch: Data roles. Address Analytics versus data engineering through one bounded case, source set or experiment. Exclude an all-purpose survey of the whole niche; distinguish the case's findings from broader claims.
