+## Subject map
+
+| Category | Research mode | Topic proposals |
+|---|---|---:|
+| CATALOG-463-01: Teaching code | media | 3 |
+| CATALOG-463-02: Learning tasks | technical | 3 |
+| CATALOG-463-03: Assessment | science | 3 |
