+## Subject map
+
+| Category | Research mode | Topic proposals |
+|---|---|---:|
+| CATALOG-499-01: Insurance mechanics | finance | 3 |
+| CATALOG-499-02: Product categories | finance | 3 |
+| CATALOG-499-03: Claims literacy | civic | 3 |
