+| Category | Research mode | Topic proposals |
+|---|---|---:|
+| CATALOG-502-01: Rehabilitation systems | health | 3 |
+| CATALOG-502-02: Contexts | health | 3 |
+| CATALOG-502-03: Access | civic | 3 |
