+#### BANK-506-001 — Lease clauses
+
+**Video question:** Lease clauses: how do the rules and institutions work in a named jurisdiction?
+
+**Coverage boundary:** Primary context: Housing & Tenancy; branch: Housing rights. Address Lease clauses through one bounded case, source set or experiment. Exclude an all-purpose survey of the whole niche; distinguish the case's findings from broader claims.
