+#### BANK-507-001 — Source protection
+
+**Video question:** Source protection: what does current evidence establish for a defined population?
+
+**Coverage boundary:** Primary context: Water & Sanitation; branch: Water safety. Address Source protection through one bounded case, source set or experiment. Exclude an all-purpose survey of the whole niche; distinguish the case's findings from broader claims.
