+## Subject map
+
+| Category | Research mode | Topic proposals |
+|---|---|---:|
+| CATALOG-526-01: Historical methods | history | 3 |
+| CATALOG-526-02: Land and institutions | history | 3 |
+| CATALOG-526-03: Ethics | civic | 3 |
