+**Video question:** Retrospective memory: what do contemporary records establish, and what remains uncertain?
+
+**Coverage boundary:** Primary context: Oral History; branch: Interpretation. Address Retrospective memory through one bounded case, source set or experiment. Exclude an all-purpose survey of the whole niche; distinguish the case's findings from broader claims.
