+
+| Category | Research mode | Topic proposals |
+|---|---|---:|
+| CATALOG-528-01: Collection systems | technical | 3 |
+| CATALOG-528-02: Access | civic | 3 |
+| CATALOG-528-03: Historical interpretation | history | 3 |
