+| Category | Research mode | Topic proposals |
+|---|---|---:|
+| CATALOG-538-01: Sleep biology | science | 3 |
+| CATALOG-538-02: Measurement | health | 3 |
+| CATALOG-538-03: Health context | health | 3 |
