+
+**Video question:** Andal's devotional voice: how do named sources and interpreters explain it?
+
+**Coverage boundary:** Primary context: Bhakti Literature & Devotional Poetry; branch: Poets and texts. Address Andal's devotional voice through one bounded case, source set or experiment. Exclude an all-purpose survey of the whole niche; distinguish the case's findings from broader claims.
