+| Category | Research mode | Topic proposals |
+|---|---|---:|
+| CATALOG-545-01: Civilizations | history | 4 |
+| CATALOG-545-02: Everyday evidence | history | 4 |
+| CATALOG-545-03: Ideas and interpretation | tradition | 4 |
