+#### BANK-548-001 — Hierarchy
+
+**Video question:** Hierarchy: which creative choices change what the audience understands?
+
+**Coverage boundary:** Primary context: Graphic Design & Visual Communication; branch: Visual foundations. Address Hierarchy through one bounded case, source set or experiment. Exclude an all-purpose survey of the whole niche; distinguish the case's findings from broader claims.
+
+**Deep-dive research outline:**
+
+- Identify the audience, format and communication problem for Hierarchy.
+- Annotate a specific scene, design or draft to show how the creative choice works.
+- Compare a revised version and explain what information, feeling or interpretation changes.
+- Check accessibility, rights, consent and possible misreadings before treating the example as a reusable method.
