+| Category | Research mode | Topic proposals |
+|---|---|---:|
+| CATALOG-550-01: Audio production | technical | 4 |
+| CATALOG-550-02: Sound design | media | 4 |
+| CATALOG-550-03: Delivery | technical | 4 |
